]","children":"5.3"}],["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]","children":["Audits","."]}]," ","NeoWork will make available compliance information and, on reasonable request and subject to confidentiality, relevant third-party audit reports (such as its SOC 2, once available), and will accommodate reasonable audits as required by Data Protection Law."]}]]]}]
